<span data-as=3D"p">Using the async programming paradigm can produce signif=
icant performance improvements when running <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia=
.org/wiki/I/O_bound" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link">IO=
