ich automatically handles tools returning <a href=3D"https://reference.lang=
chain.com/python/langgraph/types/#langgraph.types.Command" target=3D"_blank=
" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>Command</code></a> objects and pr=
opagates them to the graph state. If you=E2=80=99re writing a custom node t=
